    <h1>What a website should <em>earn for your business</em></h1>
    <p>Every owner eventually asks: <em>if I spend $2,100 a year on the site, what do I get back?</em> Here's the math: four things a well-built site improves, a worked example for a typical local business, and two ways to check it yourself.</p>
